{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2665\ufe0fStory Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>As the scenery outside your window slows and fades into the distance, you finally arrive at your summer destination\u2014Onsen Town, a quiet and remote village hidden away from the bustle of the city.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>With no internet due to its location, you\u2019ve traveled here with your mother, who was transferred for work, to help the town build its first communication tower.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Along the journey to restore the town\u2019s vitality, who will you meet, and what stories will unfold? A warm and healing summer awaits\u2014filled with possibilities for you to discover.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/7cbeea5465c84bae344e999213b33bab.avif?t=1773892986\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2b50Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rural Scenery \u2014 Find Healing in Relaxation</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Onsen Town, you leave behind the noise of the city. Here, you\u2019ll be greeted by star-filled night skies, endless blue oceans, and\u2014most of all\u2014the peaceful moments shared with the people who live here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this small village with limited connectivity, lift your gaze, listen to the gentle music, and discover the beauty hidden in everyday life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/43eec1217f8283c04e401d3d0231b89d.avif?t=1773892986\" width=1485 height=828 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/a6969664c865b947898bceff6de96dd7.avif?t=1773892986\" width=1489 height=829 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/a3c0d43d506efb9229991815a5e16e2c.avif?t=1773892986\" width=1488 height=830 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life in the Village \u2014 Busy, Yet Fulfilling</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To help revive the town, you\u2019ll earn money through various daily activities while enjoying the slow pace of countryside life. From fishing and bug catching to part-time jobs, running a stall, or sharing posts on SNS\u2014there are countless ways to contribute to the town\u2019s restoration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And of course, what would rural life be without farming and fishing? Harvest the vegetables you\u2019ve grown, cook meals with your freshly caught fish, and savor the simple flavors of the countryside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/107153410aaf15cdf83d1d40c65c7730.avif?t=1773892986\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/ed3ac4eddc083ee1cb06ae887c79f02e.avif?t=1773892986\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Characters \u2014 Grow Through Companionship</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your third day in the town, you can choose to live as the Mayor or Kyoko, the visiting girl. Once selected, you will play as that character for the day, while the other will go about their own life based on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it\u2019s the hometown Mayor or the newly arrived Kyoko\u2014both are part of this little community, each experiencing their own journey in Onsen Town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/f502f9828f2841d8682715fc1cc5ce1d.avif?t=1773892986\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/c84a1ebbbe739b0e92d34a27a3812454.avif?t=1773892986\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: The game is still under development and all content is subject to change. More features and gameplay will be added before the official release\u2014please stay tuned and continue supporting <strong>Revive! Onsen Town!</strong>\uff01</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3573190?t=1773892986","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/7e069b2f3691af0ad7284c54034ba1d367e0b359/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773892986","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/af94dadc86f00ad5ccf2f90863ee5e8e7249158a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773892986","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/af94dadc86f00ad5ccf2f90863ee5e8e7249158a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773892986","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>FOLLOW US</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/2d2927883310f2f0fa538d6083738d37.avif?t=1773892986\" width=1510 height=490 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2665\ufe0fStory Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>As the scenery outside your window slows and fades into the distance, you finally arrive at your summer destination\u2014Onsen Town, a quiet and remote village hidden away from the bustle of the city.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>With no internet due to its location, you\u2019ve traveled here with your mother, who was transferred for work, to help the town build its first communication tower.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Along the journey to restore the town\u2019s vitality, who will you meet, and what stories will unfold? A warm and healing summer awaits\u2014filled with possibilities for you to discover.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/7cbeea5465c84bae344e999213b33bab.avif?t=1773892986\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2b50Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rural Scenery \u2014 Find Healing in Relaxation</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Onsen Town, you leave behind the noise of the city. Here, you\u2019ll be greeted by star-filled night skies, endless blue oceans, and\u2014most of all\u2014the peaceful moments shared with the people who live here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this small village with limited connectivity, lift your gaze, listen to the gentle music, and discover the beauty hidden in everyday life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/43eec1217f8283c04e401d3d0231b89d.avif?t=1773892986\" width=1485 height=828 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ct