haracter for the day, while the other will go about their own life based on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it\u2019s the hometown Mayor or the newly arrived Kyoko\u2014both are part of this little community, each experiencing their own journey in Onsen Town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/f502f9828f2841d8682715fc1cc5ce1d.avif?t=1773892986\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/c84a1ebbbe739b0e92d34a27a3812454.avif?t=1773892986\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: The game is still under development and all content is subject to change. More features and gameplay will be added before the official release\u2014please stay tuned and continue supporting <strong>Revive! Onsen Town!</strong>\uff01</i></p>","developers":["\u997c\u997c Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/ccaf7b67e3f4a8f45bbaffe05ce6f9a5e0dfa93f/header.jpg?t=1773892986","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3573190/949707226/a7c10bb78abd5514c9aea73ccab592824cf8a9da/1752995433/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753014711","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3573190/949707226/a7c10bb78abd5514c9aea73ccab592824cf8a9da/1752995433/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753014711","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3573190/949707226/a7c10bb78abd5514c9aea73ccab592824cf8a9da/1752995433/hls_264_maste